        "original_id": "6c9f85a0-4182-5a41-abe5-945fc28cf095",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Ezhou, Yangzhong, Taizhou, Zhenjiang Municipality, Yaoqiao Village, Hubei Province, Jiangsu Province, China\n- People: Chen Xunqiu\n- Roles: party chief\n- Products: Taizhou Yangtze River Bridge\n\nFacts:\n- Ezhou is a prefecture-level city in eastern Hubei Province, China.\n- In 1996, Chen Xunqiu was named party chief of Ezhou.\n- Yangzhong is a county-level city under the administration of Zhenjiang in Jiangsu Province, China.\n- The Taizhou Yangtze River Bridge connects Taizhou on the north bank, Yangzhong on an island in the river, and Yaoqiao Village of Zhenjiang Municipality on the south bank.\n- The Taizhou Yangtze River Bridge consists of a suspension bridge across the north branch stream and a pair of box-girder bridges across the south branch stream.",
